[h1]Magocracy Government[/h1]

A government for realms ruled by mages. Built for CK3 1.21, as a companion to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3611795747]Secrets of Ambrosius[/url].

[b]Requires:[/b] Secrets of Ambrosius, and the [b]Roads to Power[/b] and [b]Silk and Silver[/b] DLCs.

[h2]The Magocracy[/h2]
A Magocracy combines the administrative realm of governors, noble families and title men-at-arms with the trade of a merchant republic. Its great houses live in Mage's Communes, may found trade posts, and elect the head of the realm from among the mightiest mages.

[list]
[*][b]Found the Magocracy[/b]: a Magister ruling at least a duchy can reform their realm (1,000 prestige and gold).
[*][b]Three paths[/b]: the Warmage, Arcane and Merchant-Mage Magocracies.
[*][b]The Conclave[/b]: choose who sits on it (Magisters, Houses, a High Conclave or all magi), how much power it holds (Constitutional, Legislative or Ceremonial), and the majority it needs.
[*][b]Succession[/b]: Magocratic Election by the Conclave, or Magocratic Appointment.
[*][b]Mage's Commune[/b]: the seat of a noble house, with estate and company buildings and room for ten buildings around its main hall. Communes can be raided like other estates.
[*][b]Ten magic decrees[/b]: Mandate Arcane Study, Levy the Mana Tithe, Ward the Capital, Perform the Rite of Plenty, Muster the War-Mages, Proscribe the Forbidden Arts, Sanction the Blood Rites, Search for the Gifted, Grant from the State Forges and Open the Arcane Archives.
[*][b]Valyrian District[/b]: a quarter of black stone and spires, raised by sorcery.
[*][b]Great projects[/b]: the Valyrian Spires, a Mage's Spire, the Blackstone Roads and the Blackstone Walls.
[*]Events and decisions for the Mage's Commune.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Replaces the following base game files, so it is incompatible with other mods that edit them:
[list]
[*]common/character_interactions/00_grant_titles_interaction.txt
[*]events/scheme_events/scheme_critical_moments_events.txt
[*]gui/window_domicile.gui
[*]gui/window_government_republic.gui
[/list]

Secrets of Ambrosius also replaces 00_grant_titles_interaction.txt; load this mod after it.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Bug reports and suggestions are always welcome.
